  "body": "An architectural statement of rare distinction, “Sea Cube” delivers a lifestyle reminiscent of an exclusive coastal resort, rising above one of Long Bay’s most prestigious coastal addresses and capturing sweeping sea and reserve panoramas in a setting defined by privacy, prestige, and permanence — yet only moments from Long Bay Village, the beach, and scenic coastal walkways.\r\n\r\nA landmark residence for those who seek the exceptional.\r\n\r\nArtful Spaces & Split-Level Grandeur\r\nSpanning a vast 556sqm floor area on a 644sqm section, the interior unfolds across cleverly engineered split-level layout, offering both intimacy and immense scale:\r\n\r\n- The Arrival: A rare four-car garage and a professional office suite. The ocean-facing lounge and versatile multifunctional zone feature soaring four-metre ceilings, capturing breathtaking panoramic views of the Hauraki Gulf.\r\n- Elevated Living: A few steps up lead to the open-plan designer kitchen and dining area,flowing effortlessly and complemented by a dedicated scullery (Chinese kitchen) and a private ensuite.\r\n- Rest & Retreat: Two further ensuite bedrooms and a cosy sitting room open onto twin balconies, capturing light and breeze from every angle.\r\n- The Sanctuary: The crown jewel of the home is the expansive master suite. Spanning approximately 120sqm, this oceanfront sanctuary includes a cavernous walk-in wardrobe and a spa-like bathroom. A second office is located at the other end of the home.\r\n\r\nUnrivalled Specification\r\nNo expense has been spared in creating a residence of remarkable quality.\r\n\r\n- Premium Materials & Craftsmanship: American oak flooring, commercial-grade joinery, an oversized solid granite kitchen island, and Vitex decking establish a refined yet durable material palette throughout.\r\n- European Excellence: The home is fully appointed with premium imported European kitchen and bathroom fittings, including top-tier Miele appliances and Koller smart toilets.\r\n- High-Tech Comfort: Designed for modern living with 3-phase power, central air conditioning, a central vacuum system, and integrated smart home features.\r\n\r\nSetting & Lifestyle Convenience\r\nBordering a pristine regional reserve, the home enjoys complete privacy with uninterrupted outlooks and protected ocean vistas. Despite its tranquil setting, Long Bay Regional Park, Long Bay Beach, and the popular Long Bay Surf Club are all just moments away, complemented by cafés, a gym, and everyday amenities within Long Bay Village. Albany Mega Centre, Westfield Albany, and leading private schools including Pinehurst and Kristin are all within easy driving distance.\r\n\r\nThis is more than a home; it is a lifestyle of uncompromising luxury and design. Your coastal legacy starts here.",
